<p>I just can't get into this one.<br />
- It's a thing that makes people love it. We have those.<br />
- Forming multiple attachments is uncommon if not rare, but apparently &quot;several&quot; cases have been documented wherein multiple attachments have been observed. I assume these were all while in Foundation custody&#8230; why are they experimenting that much on what seems to be a pretty simple anomalous effect?<br />
- It happened to turn up at a Foundation-run front hotel?<br />
- The description of its behavior seems at odds with the time frame suggested by the hotel incident and the multi-attachment observations.<br />
- Some grammar issues.</p>
<p>Overall the execution just feels muddy, and the overall idea is too simple to really latch onto. The most unsettling part of it is immediately obvious from the photo and the first paragraph of the description.</p>

